 <h3><u>Allah Muje Lashkare mehdi se mila de</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span class=userContent>Allah mujhe lashkar e mehdi se mila de<br> Allah mujhe lashkar e mehdi se mila<br> de...AMEEN<br> Aisa na ho aaka mera halmin ki sada<span class=text_exposed_show><br> de<br> nazro ko meri layake didar bana de<br> parda jo pada he meri ankho pe utha<br> de<br> hadi e zama karo pe purnur dikha de<br> Allah mujhe lashkar e mehdi se mila de<br> Allah mujhe lashkar e mehdi se mila<br> de...AMEEN<br> har ek nisha ko pro zalalat ka mita du<br> har rah me ek dip sadaqat ka jala du<br> iss khair e amal ki mujhe taufeek<br> khuda de<br> Allah mujhe lashkar e mehdi se mila<br> de...AMEEN<br> likh de meri taqdeer me maula ki<br> ghulami<br> hasil mujhe ho jaye ye ezaz dawami<br> har khwaish e duniya ko mere dil se<br> mita de<br> Allah mujhe lashkar e mehdi se mila<br> de...AMEEN<br> shamil rahe lehje me sada har pe<br> sadaqat<br> shamshir tale me bhi karo koi ibadat<br> ay kash mujhe fatima zehra ye dua de<br> Allah mujhe lashkar e mehdi se mila<br> de...AMEEN<br> shabbir ke ansar me shamil ho mera<br> naam<br> jo hur ka ho mehshar me wohi ho<br> mera anjaam<br> kha ke kadam e hazrat shabbir bana<br> de<br> Allah mujhe lashkar e mehdi se mila<br> de...AMEEN<br> dekhu na agar uthte huwe parda e<br> ghaibat<br> aye jo mere baad yaha hazrat e hujjat<br> turbat me abad ko mera shaana hila<br> de<br> Allah mujhe lashkar e mehdi se mila<br> de...AMEEN</span></span></p> 
